# Keep the training image's build context small and reproducible -- avoid baking in
# stray local artifacts from a dirty working tree (checkpoints, logs, model caches,
# generated norm-stats). The committed assets/itw_normalization/ JSON is explicitly
# NOT excluded here (only assets/* generally is), since it must ship in the image.
assets/*
!assets/itw_normalization/
checkpoints/
logs/
models/
# .git/ is intentionally NOT excluded (unlike a typical .dockerignore) -- the image
# ships a real git checkout on purpose so `git pull` works inside a running container
# for a future code update without a full rebuild. Build FROM A CLEAN CHECKOUT (a
# fresh `git clone`, not a dirty local working tree) so what ships is exactly what's
# on the remote, not stray uncommitted local changes.
